<header class="ref-head cen-head"><p class="cty-kicker">History by century · The 100s</p><h1 class="research-title">The 2nd century</h1><p class="ref-lede">In the 100s, 180 recorded states existed somewhere in the world. 49 were founded and 16 came to an end. The great powers of the age included the Roman Empire, the Kushan Empire and the Han Dynasty.</p></header>
